(`hero_capsule_alt_assets_20_2x.jpg`, 748 x 896, about 0.83:1) is the
current Warzone art with "CALL OF DUTY WARZONE" on it, so it is the one. It
is less tall than 2:3, and the tall slot draws it whole with soft edges
