**Black Ops 7's tall picture is its vertical capsule too, for the same
reason.** Its app id, 3606480, was read off its store page
(`store.steampowered.com/app/3606480`) on 2026-09-23. The header row is the
`header_image` of Steam's `appdetails` API, less its `?t=` stamp. Steam's
`GetItems` API names no library capsule for this app (with or without
